<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 1-MTH BUBOR RATE FLAT, 3-MTH, 6-MTH EASES.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 1-MTH BUBOR RATE FLAT, 3-MTH, 6-MTH EASES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was steady on Wednesday for the one month maturity and eased for three and six months, the National Bank of Hungary said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.80 percent, unchanged, the three-month rate at 20.72 percent, down 0.01 while the six-month rate was set at 20.47 percent, down 0.02.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
